{"title":"2026 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/f/cef431e072d4181177607af91930516cffdec55c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4X + 1 = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/735343697bb30c77cd24c0c7daa3ae3da62298e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12X + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/b/d5bd859fb76730e09cff60dcf081d3876d99953e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   27 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   30 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   33 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   36 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   39 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/f/cef431e072d4181177607af91930516cffdec55c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4X + 1 = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b464e06958a1860b690e3b56274aca40117019fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a1aa338bb19bd513c27a9b858241967420951c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12X + 3 = 12\\cdot{3} + 3 = 36 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} 39}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"319\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~any1sgame and minor edit by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Faster)\">Solution 2 (Faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/735343697bb30c77cd24c0c7daa3ae3da62298e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12X + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"16\" /> is three times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/0/1c09fbc9952844518f1a322e2e9c32339a49feb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4X + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d859b57179dd27004daa2f2f0b8c5dbefa2e958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot{13} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)} 39}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~any1sgame and minor edit by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2026 CEMC Cayley\">2026 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"n